direction: right
experience: Experience team { portal: Research portal; auth: Identity; notify: Notifications }
platform: Platform team { gateway: Edge gateway; mesh: Service mesh; delivery: Delivery controller }
data: Data team { ingest: Ingestion; quality: Quality engine; lake: Observation lake }
science: Science team { model: Assimilation; forecast: Forecast API; alert: Coastal alerting }
reliability: Reliability { slo: SLO catalog; telemetry: Telemetry; incident: Incident command }
experience.portal -> platform.gateway
platform.gateway -> data.ingest
data.ingest -> data.quality -> data.lake
data.lake -> science.model -> science.forecast
science.forecast -> experience.portal
science.model -> science.alert -> experience.notify
reliability.slo -> platform.gateway
reliability.slo -> science.forecast
platform.mesh -> reliability.telemetry
data.quality -> reliability.telemetry
reliability.telemetry -> reliability.incident
reliability.incident -> platform.delivery
